{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":43,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["神应许拯救他的子民"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"雅各啊，创造你的耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，造成你的那位，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不要害怕！因为我救赎了你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾提你的名召你，你是属我的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你从水中经过，我必与你同在；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你趟过江河，水必不漫过你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你从火中行过，必不被烧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"火焰也不着在你身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我是耶和华—你的 神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是以色列的圣者—你的救主；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已经使埃及作你的赎价，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使古实和西巴代替你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我看你为宝为尊；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又因我爱你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我使人代替你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使列邦人替换你的生命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要害怕，因我与你同在；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必领你的后裔从东方来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又从西方招聚你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要对北方说，交出来！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对南方说，不要拘留！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将我的众子从远方带来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将我的众女从地极领回，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是凡称为我名下的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我为自己的荣耀创造的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我所做成，所造作的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列是耶和华的见证人"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"你要将有眼而瞎、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有耳而聋的民都带出来！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"任凭万国聚集；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"任凭众民会合。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中谁能将此声明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并将先前的事说给我们听呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们可以带出见证来，自显为是；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或者他们听见便说：这是真的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：你们是我的见证，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我所拣选的仆人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"既是这样，便可以知道，且信服我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又明白我就是耶和华。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我以前没有真神","poem":1},{"noteId":41},{"text":"；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我以后也必没有。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惟有我是耶和华；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除我以外没有救主。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾指示，我曾拯救，我曾说明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并且在你们中间没有别神。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们是我的见证。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也是 神；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自从有日子以来，我就是 神；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁也不能救人脱离我手。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要行事谁能阻止呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["逃离巴比伦"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"耶和华—你们的救赎主、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的圣者如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你们的缘故，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已经打发人到巴比伦去；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并且我要使迦勒底人如逃民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都坐自己喜乐的船下来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是耶和华—你们的圣者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是创造以色列的，是你们的君王。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华在沧海中开道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在大水中开路，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使车辆、马匹、军兵、勇士都出来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一同躺下，不再起来；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们灭没，好像熄灭的灯火。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们不要记念从前的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不要思想古时的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，我要做一件新事；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今要发现，你们岂不知道吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必在旷野开道路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在沙漠开江河。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"野地的走兽必尊重我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"野狗和鸵鸟也必如此。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我使旷野有水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使沙漠有河，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好赐给我的百姓、我的选民喝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这百姓是我为自己所造的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好述说我的美德。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列人的罪恶"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"雅各啊，你并没有求告我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，你倒厌烦我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你没有将你的羊带来给我作燔祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也没有用祭物尊敬我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我没有因供物使你服劳，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也没有因乳香使你厌烦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你没有用银子为我买菖蒲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也没有用祭物的脂油使我饱足；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倒使我因你的罪恶服劳，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我因你的罪孽厌烦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"惟有我为自己的缘故涂抹你的过犯；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不记念你的罪恶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要提醒我，你我可以一同辩论；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你可以将你的理陈明，自显为义。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的始祖犯罪；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的师傅违背我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要辱没圣所的首领，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使雅各成为咒诅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使以色列成为辱骂。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":41,"caller":"-","text":"真：原文是造作的","reference":{"chapter":43,"verse":10}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/43.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/44.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/42.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":28}